WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.400
The sign rules for integers work for fractions and decimals too.

2
00:00:05.126 --> 00:00:07.551
Three jumps of a half: one and a half.

3
00:00:08.704 --> 00:00:11.504
Three jumps of negative a half go left.

4
00:00:15.487 --> 00:00:19.812
Negative three jumps go the opposite way: positive one and a half.
